  <content>
  <section><list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> Write equivalent expressions using the distributive property. </item>
  <item> Find the \(x\)-intercepts of the graph of a quadratic equation given in factored form. </item>
  <item> Match quadratic graphs and their functions. </item>
</list>
<para>If you are still struggling, be sure to reach out to your teacher for additional help. Nobody is good at problems like this the first try. Keep at it, and it will get easier.</para></section>
</content>
